{
  "id": "abeefd9c587b43e43a6769a9",
  "title": "鹿角蕨和我们的餐桌丨日日食，好时光",
  "summary": "时间像是手指间的沙砾，哗哗就从指缝间滑下去，遁入虚空。 抬头一看，发现日历已翻到9月。我连忙整理了书写的日志，记录在这里。 以前我在厨房里做饭时，总会有点烦躁。 租的农民房屋厨房简陋，墙上有黑乎乎的油渍。厨房只有电炉，不能爆炒只能慢吞吞地烧煮。我一直幻想着以后搞一个有漫长中岛的现代化大厨房，四处闪闪发亮，有大烤箱蒸箱，还有5个口的瓦斯炉，然后我就可以快快乐乐地做饭了。 然而在某一天，我突然意识到，我在此时此刻就可以快快乐乐做饭！做饭这个行为的本质是不变的！我正在处理食材，我正在创造一顿饭，我正在为爱的人做饭，我正在为滋养自己的身体做饭，香味从锅里飘起来了，食材正在变得美味，这些就是做饭的全部。我在现代化厨房和简陋厨房体验的本质都是这些东西，既然如此，那么我自然也可以就在这个简陋的厨房里，将心态调整到快乐的样子…",
  "content": "<p><span><span><span>时间像是手指间的沙砾，哗哗就从指缝间滑下去，遁入虚空。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>抬头一看，发现日历已翻到9月。我连忙整理了书写的日志，记录在这里。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>以前我在厨房里做饭时，总会有点烦躁。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>租的农民房屋厨房简陋，墙上有黑乎乎的油渍。厨房只有电炉，不能爆炒只能慢吞吞地烧煮。我一直幻想着以后搞一个有漫长中岛的现代化大厨房，四处闪闪发亮，有大烤箱蒸箱，还有5个口的瓦斯炉，然后我就可以快快乐乐地做饭了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>然而在某一天，我突然意识到，我在此时此刻就可以快快乐乐做饭！做饭这个行为的本质是不变的！我正在处理食材，我正在创造一顿饭，我正在为爱的人做饭，我正在为滋养自己的身体做饭，香味从锅里飘起来了，食材正在变得美味，这些就是做饭的全部。我在现代化厨房和简陋厨房体验的本质都是这些东西，既然如此，那么我自然也可以就在这个简陋的厨房里，将心态调整到快乐的样子，带着轻松愉悦的心情做饭，我不必等着遥远的未来降临，我一直拥有做饭的本质，它从不曾发生过变化。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>多么奇异啊，天堂和地狱，其实就在此时此刻人的心里。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br></p><p><span><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span></p><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨竹笋烧鸭和肉末泡豇豆丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEinlas7duz7LRavf3pwfogRM1kajtaAbW6bvLCiP3Xhi-f2MgUwbvgSO9ZIfaZOpnooGDnrSYALK1tNciWy8lYsbl074dXpPHWtY72hIjvewwCxFvUE13mkAkm4t4V5sWtmkbFdtf7aU9ZQaYRwavy-B4pxvegeu62DqNFj56jqkVpb5JCOinO5hRZ4pOs6/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260805152919_370_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEinlas7duz7LRavf3pwfogRM1kajtaAbW6bvLCiP3Xhi-f2MgUwbvgSO9ZIfaZOpnooGDnrSYALK1tNciWy8lYsbl074dXpPHWtY72hIjvewwCxFvUE13mkAkm4t4V5sWtmkbFdtf7aU9ZQaYRwavy-B4pxvegeu62DqNFj56jqkVpb5JCOinO5hRZ4pOs6/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260805152919_370_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这一日，我买了点鸭腿来做菜。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>就鸭子而言，我喜欢吃没有骨头的鸭鸭，所以在制作时，我总会先把鸭腿骨头仔细剃掉。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>因为家里有老狗子小胖，所以鸭腿肉不会剃净，在鸭腿骨上，我会特意给小胖留下比较多的肉。等鸭腿骨煮好之后，小胖可以开开心心有滋有味地啃上老半天。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>从鸭腿上切下来的鸭肉，切成片，拿到锅里用油煎香，随后加生抽、糖和醋，以及淹没鸭肉的水，用红烧的方式把鸭肉焖软。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>等鸭肉基本上焖软了，再掀开锅盖加入仔姜以及竹笋。我用的是超市的袋装清水竹笋，它们已经是熟的，所以竹笋并不需要特别长的烹饪时间，只要烧得入味了，就可以出锅。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>夏季的餐桌上，肉末炒泡豇豆总是会不断地重复出现。泡豇豆在一些地方被叫做酸豆角。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>新鲜豇豆切碎炒起来是另外的味道，搭配肉末品尝起来总觉得差点滋味。而泡豇豆自带发酵的酸味，和肉末炒在一起，是绝妙的下饭菜。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>如此，美美的一餐饭就齐活了，开吃！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></div><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><br></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨肉末拌米粉丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjpbfYvWrF2oo-STmu0AgaVfh6gRORdn0itKfOe7kf5nGr3xliR1PwDLJMUCo42PQ-pjkpju1VjdGqy2znzDp_9E8aPobMEC-EW1c1IagDuK12GHofGdKQTfdUTbShFNqGOYg7VWWXABxzgCodW51yJAJSOibsnHjxVrwIfOG64GuYq4xKBpu_RQqWUy_M9/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260814201718_428_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjpbfYvWrF2oo-STmu0AgaVfh6gRORdn0itKfOe7kf5nGr3xliR1PwDLJMUCo42PQ-pjkpju1VjdGqy2znzDp_9E8aPobMEC-EW1c1IagDuK12GHofGdKQTfdUTbShFNqGOYg7VWWXABxzgCodW51yJAJSOibsnHjxVrwIfOG64GuYq4xKBpu_RQqWUy_M9/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260814201718_428_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><span><br></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这一天的晚餐做的是肉末拌米粉吃。橘子吃面容易烧心，吃米粉则很适应。于是我把家里的面条都更换成了米粉。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这种宽米粉煮好了再炒也很好吃。只是那样制作，油未免有点太多，米粉吸油相当厉害呢。而把米粉煮好，捞出来沥干水，再淋上佐料和浇头拌着吃，则能少吃很多油，同时滋味又好，何乐而不为呢？</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨醋炒荷包蛋丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdupa6WtTPpBpiYdVVMbtkuPrfKc741iSkjDz6bJ2e8n5FZm1VPpMJ6S9hsdGF0-yOSuJQtepTazSUFUyZW303IntRS_595lFUUW6Cc1SZ0fmBZaDFgPlhxwS1yqZH2B3iJNgfVCNU1E4byDKjOWVDgQEogDmSJY68Z3V2gh34O_CMMhN2yY-0jWfhDB-z/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260831134057_448_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdupa6WtTPpBpiYdVVMbtkuPrfKc741iSkjDz6bJ2e8n5FZm1VPpMJ6S9hsdGF0-yOSuJQtepTazSUFUyZW303IntRS_595lFUUW6Cc1SZ0fmBZaDFgPlhxwS1yqZH2B3iJNgfVCNU1E4byDKjOWVDgQEogDmSJY68Z3V2gh34O_CMMhN2yY-0jWfhDB-z/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260831134057_448_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><span><br></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><p><span><span><span><span><span>经常到了晚餐的时候我不想解冻肉，于是便做份炒蛋当荤菜吃。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>醋炒荷包蛋的步骤很简单，其实就是先把五个蛋煎好，铲出来，随后在锅里的余油里下蒜粒、剁辣椒和葱，然后倒入两勺生抽，三勺醋，一勺白糖，将炒好的煎蛋重新下锅将佐料的味儿裹上去就行了，我在炒蛋里还加了点香菇片。翻炒几下，等香菇熟透就可以一起出锅了。不喜欢醋味儿的话，可以把醋的用量减至一勺。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>这种回锅炒蛋里，加小芹菜也好吃，加青椒也好吃，端看个人喜好，以及冰箱里还有什么剩菜。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>吃的时候，我问橘子：“酸味儿够了吗？下次要不要多加一点醋？”</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>他喊道：“够了够了，已经很酸了，千万不要再加了，下次可以少一点点醋。”</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>好的，我们俩在酸度的品尝上总是存在差异，哈哈哈哈。</span></span></span></span></span></p></div><div><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨紫苏烧虾仁丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>院子里的紫苏简直泛滥成灾。紫苏这东西具有极其顽强的生命力，种过一次之后，它便自己在院子里自我播种繁衍，每年刷新一大片出来。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>看着那么大一片紫苏，我做菜，便也开始经常摘几片紫苏的叶子，切碎了扔进菜品里。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>紫苏有种奇异的挥发性味道，习惯之后，觉得还蛮好吃。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>今日的午餐，制作的是红烧虾仁，酒糟鸡和清炒包菜。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>把虾仁以红烧的方式制作，等烧得差不多汁开始收得浓厚，要起锅的时候，放入一大把紫苏叶子进去，翻炒一下。</span></span></span></span><span></span><span><span><span>等紫苏叶子完全断生以后，就可以关火铲出来上桌啦~~~</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>其实做起来很简单啊。我喜欢制作简单的菜品~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨鹿角蕨丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj1upDugLLHLsBCZSMczbwUHWHKgoaQE9XHb5rUpuIVZz8vVbJsrKnCQA3Db8vJprgBaKvvuR6jlY34pgXwGVh37wYWfE8Cr1p7pO4eobu_N58IUt9l3totcWd5RT5E7_yReE47AzuRlRltmzJZCkU3cvOU4PfjOn3A5rMpUBjJvuP7bGjENmUP9d90BNax/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260715193323_237_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj1upDugLLHLsBCZSMczbwUHWHKgoaQE9XHb5rUpuIVZz8vVbJsrKnCQA3Db8vJprgBaKvvuR6jlY34pgXwGVh37wYWfE8Cr1p7pO4eobu_N58IUt9l3totcWd5RT5E7_yReE47AzuRlRltmzJZCkU3cvOU4PfjOn3A5rMpUBjJvuP7bGjENmUP9d90BNax/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260715193323_237_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br></span></b><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>经常路过的一家咖啡店门口，在香樟树干上，挂着很大一株鹿角蕨。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>啊，鹿角蕨是多么神圣优雅的造物，它简直是巨大的植物雕塑，这是多么美丽的大自然艺术品啊！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>鹿角蕨本来就有一种</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>附生植物特有的自由感</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>，仿佛它只是暂时停驻在这里，它并不真正属于任何人。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>它的</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>孢子叶一层层展开，巨大的营养叶包裹着根部，远远看过去简直就像是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>一头神话里的鹿，把自己的角留在了山林间。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>以后等我有真正属于自己的家园时，我一定要邀请一株鹿角蕨入驻。不需要名贵的品种，贵在皮实，二岐鹿角蕨就很棒！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这家店门口的鹿角蕨是比较大的品种，可能是何其美鹿角蕨。它多么美啊！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>苍蝇馆子.外食炒牛肉和牛肉汤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh9NdWLNvJjdhATbEOOtO-GwFOzYYWr55yFNZfwLKdIwEQLHeK5hzs3pjNwFWc9mdjFpA7lgk42-uiTjokiNO_NnvPgT-zQF4ihzwnb6BzEZz-vc1_FvDP5h0ugCsII0NnXLHONopdfWmdo7iqPt0Iaojm1s70r2a1JvjzsKhNdbsBC8YaLhJ4jWBvg89hi/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260831134236_453_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh9NdWLNvJjdhATbEOOtO-GwFOzYYWr55yFNZfwLKdIwEQLHeK5hzs3pjNwFWc9mdjFpA7lgk42-uiTjokiNO_NnvPgT-zQF4ihzwnb6BzEZz-vc1_FvDP5h0ugCsII0NnXLHONopdfWmdo7iqPt0Iaojm1s70r2a1JvjzsKhNdbsBC8YaLhJ4jWBvg89hi/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260831134236_453_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><span><br></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子的友人来访，友人讲今天太热了，出去吃饭吧，每天做饭也烦人的。于是，我们便与友人一同驱车去吃路边的苍蝇馆子。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这家小馆子主打牛肉，于是点了青椒牛肉、牛肉炒口蘑、泡萝卜炒牛肉和牛肉大白豆汤。素菜是清炒丝瓜。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>泡萝卜炒牛肉是我点的，我很喜欢这种酸辣口味的菜，下饭神器。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>牛肉大白豆汤很鲜美，大白豆已经软糯，吃起来绵绵的，好喜欢这种口感呀~</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>苍蝇馆子虽然装修简略，但是味道都很好呐~</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span></p><h4><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨写在文后丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></h4><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我一直在进行饮食记录。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>因为食物是我与世界一个非常基础的原始连接点。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>人们最早的仪式，就和食物有关。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>收获，</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>烹饪，</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>分享，</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>感谢，</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>节庆，</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>很多文化里的祭祀，本质上是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我们承认生命给予我们的事物，此时此刻</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我们</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>感谢这一切。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>所以当我认真写下一碗醋炒荷包蛋时，其实不单单是在记录美食，我是在用这种方式重新恢复我</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>与食物的古老关系，恢复我与生活的原始连接点。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>在这种关系里，</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>食物不应简单地视作生物燃料，</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>而是食物</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这个鲜活的东西，它经过土地、阳光、雨水、人的劳动，最终来到了我的生命里。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>赞美食物，感谢食物。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>",
